<title>QATAR: Total head won't comment on Ultramar deal.</title>
<headline>Total head won't comment on Ultramar deal.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total SA Chairman Thierry Desmarest on Tuesday declined to comment on a reported move to sell Total Petroleum (North America) to Ultramar Diamond Shamrock Corp of the United States.</p>
<p>&quot;I can't comment on it,&quot; he told Reuters on a visit to Doha.</p>
<p>The Wall Street Journal reported on Tuesday that Ultramar Diamond Shamrock was in talks to buy Total Petroleum (North America) in a deal worth more than $400 million plus debt assumption of $430 million.</p>
<p>-- Dubai newsroom +9714 6071 222</p>
</text>
